  "summary": "Senior Software Engineer with deep expertise in Linux kernel, embedded systems, RTOS, virtualization, and power management. Proven track record of delivering innovative solutions at the intersection of hardware, firmware, and software. Maintainer of key open-source subsystems, conference speaker, published author, and patent holder. Passionate about computer architecture, OS internals, efficient coding, and mentoring.",
